        "Serverless SQL = General Purpose (auto-pause GA) or Hyperscale (auto-pause preview). Business Critical and DTU tiers have no serverless.",
        "Elastic pool fits many DBs with low average use and peaks at different times. If all DBs peak together, a pool saves nothing.",
