        "Read scale-out on Premium/Business Critical is free: route reporting with ApplicationIntent=ReadOnly instead of adding a replica.",
        "Need writes beyond one database's limits or strict per-tenant isolation at scale = sharding with elastic database tools.",
        "Dynamic data masking is not encryption. To hide data from DBAs use Always Encrypted.",
        "Row-level security = multi-tenant row filtering inside one database. Ledger = tamper-evidence for auditors.",
        "Cosmos partition key: high cardinality (many distinct values) + balanced access pattern. NEVER pick a low-cardinality field.",
