        "Cosmos backup: periodic is the default (every 4h, 2 copies kept). Continuous = point-in-time restore with 7-day (no backup storage charge), 30-day, or 35-day tiers. Periodic → continuous is one-way.",
        "Synapse Link for Cosmos DB is not for new projects. Analytics on Cosmos/Azure SQL without ETL = Fabric mirroring.",
